  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W47",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周先驱四场比赛，黑绿恶魔的高分占比升到21.9%，拿下九个八强。白绿军伍最近一直有上升趋势，以12.5%的高分占比排第二，六个八强。铁木尔课程继续有成绩，本周一个冠军、四个八强。",
          "en": "Pioneer had four events this week. Golgari Demons rose to a 21.9% share of high-scoring decklists and took nine Top 8 slots. Selesnya Company has been gaining ground lately and finished second at 12.5%, with six Top 8 appearances. Temur Lessons continued to put up results, winning one event and making four Top 8s."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "deck:7257c4e6570b3c0b3eab：这周开始[[card:Anthropological Mission|人类学任务]]在先驱也开始流行，并有蓝黑、红蓝两条路线。先驱的黑色低费咒语更厉害，还有标准已经被禁的蓝才能配合[[card:Boomerang Basics|飞去来入门]]，充分发挥任务的大量过牌优势。低费处理对手威胁的同时过牌，水獭的灵技还能把过牌咒语转化成伤害，才能本身自己还是一个游戏计划。这套蓝黑在本周的成绩相当出色，说实话我已经开始嗅到禁牌的味道了。",
          "en": "deck:7257c4e6570b3c0b3eab: [[card:Anthropological Mission|Anthropological Mission]] started to catch on in Pioneer this week, with both Dimir and Izzet builds finding success. Black offers stronger cheap spells in Pioneer, and [[card:Stormchaser's Talent|Stormchaser's Talent]], which is already banned in Standard, combines with [[card:Boomerang Basics|Boomerang Basics]] to make the most of Mission's card draw. The deck draws cards while answering opposing threats cheaply, and the Otter's prowess turns those draw spells into damage. Talent also provides a game plan in its own right. Dimir performed exceptionally well this week; honestly, I am already starting to smell a ban."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:7257c4e6570b3c0b3eab",
            "label": {
              "zh": "蓝黑任务 · ShadowTitan1 · 第1名",
              "en": "Dimir Mission · ShadowTitan1 · Rank 1"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "dimir-mission",
              "display_name": "Dimir Mission",
              "event_id": "12858923",
              "deck_id": "7257c4e6570b3c0b3eab",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "7c2c0bf742002f4a1e97b91e11196ef8729e57e525343d3fc1923308e997f619",
              "player": "ShadowTitan1",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "starttime": "2026-11-19 23:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "deck:40f8607064b2b3a8278b：红蓝版本的任务本周也有一些成绩，但相比蓝黑版本略逊一筹。思路基本类似，但比比和[[card:Mox Amber|琥珀玛珂]]的配合让这套牌相比蓝黑爆发力更高。虽然黑色思绪和push本身的强度可能更高，但[[card:Academic Dispute|学术争执]]的高效温习和伪去除也有不低的灵活性。",
          "en": "deck:40f8607064b2b3a8278b: Izzet Mission also posted some results this week, although it trailed Dimir. The basic idea is similar, but Vivi and [[card:Mox Amber|Mox Amber]] give this version more explosive turns. [[card:Thoughtseize|Thoughtseize]] and [[card:Fatal Push|Fatal Push]] may be stronger cards individually, but [[card:Academic Dispute|Academic Dispute]] offers plenty of flexibility: it provides efficient access to Lessons and can double as makeshift removal."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:40f8607064b2b3a8278b",
            "label": {
              "zh": "红蓝任务 · Jonii · 第3名",
