          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "text": {
          "zh": "新科技方面，黑绿恶魔本周有六份八强牌表使用[[card:Salt Vampire|盐吸血鬼]]，已经成为主流（deck:a0d551dfba42a7803618）。",
          "en": "[[card:Salt Vampire|Salt Vampire]] has already become a staple in Golgari Demons: six of the archetype's Top 8 lists played it this week (deck:a0d551dfba42a7803618)."
        },
